  "idea": "Penpot: the free open-source Figma alternative for design teams",
  "text": "The open-source design tool built on web standards that anyone can use completely free. Proprietary design software locks components inside private file formats that cannot be opened outside their ecosystem. When designs cannot translate into web code, front-end engineers waste hours rebuilding layouts from scratch. Instead, build interfaces in Penpot, which generates native SVG elements and clean CSS markup directly. You accelerate development handoff while maintaining complete control over your assets.",
